sdc4:mc-z76d29pfazsvjaj2iwf8i5hf-shape a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Act Lifecycle: held nullified states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the held nullified path of the Act Lifecycle workflow, in order: held, nullified. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The lifecycle of an act in the HL7 v3 Reference Information Model: preparatory (new, held), active, suspended, and the terminal states completed, cancelled, aborted, with nullified and obsolete outside the normal course. The generic clinical and administrative act state machine." ;
